 "remarks": "Welcome to this conveniently located 2 bed / 2.5 bath end unit townhome in Glenbrook, offering over 2,300 sq. ft. of living space and TONS of storage! Enjoy an ideal location just a 5 minute walk to the Glenbrook train station, 1.2 miles to I-95, 1.3 miles to Darien Commons, and only 2.5 miles to everything Downtown Stamford has to offer. Bright and spacious, this townhome lives like a single-family home without all the maintenance. The main level features hardwood floors and a fantastic layout for entertaining, including a large living room, separate dining room with access to a deck perfect for grilling, a fully equipped kitchen, and a convenient powder room. Head upstairs to a spacious landing with cathedral ceilings, offering the perfect spot for a home office. Just a few steps up, you'll find an expansive primary bedroom with two closets and a beautifully updated en-suite bathroom. A generously sized second bedroom and its own beautifully updated full bathroom complete this level. Need more space? You've got it! The finished lower level offers endless possibilities, whether you need a third bedroom, a second home office, media room, gym, or playroom. You'll also find a large walk-in storage area and a separate laundry room with a utility sink. Doral Condominiums is a small, self-managed community offering exceptionally low monthly common charges of just $275. The building also features a new roof installed in 2021.",
